Built for
---------

Libertypedie (https://libertypedie.cz), which is where it runs in production.

Third-party content
-------------------

The extension fetches content from wikis named in $wgWikiCloneSources. That
content belongs to its own authors under its own licence — CC BY-SA 4.0 in the
case of Wikipedia — and is neither owned nor relicensed by this project. The
attribution banner the extension renders exists to keep that distinction
visible to readers.
